      "message": "This Context is an AdapterService 😊\n\nWhich allows you to keep the TransitionalScanHelper final and to:\n\n\n\n```suggestion\n    public GattService(@NonNull AdapterService adapterService) {\n        super(adapterService);\n        \n        mAdapterService \u003d requireNonNull(adapterService); // (one more final variable Yeah !)\n        \n        if (Flags.scanManagerRefactor()) {\n            mTransitionalScanHelper \u003d mAdapterService.getBluetoothScanController().getTransitionalScanHelper();\n        } else {\n            mTransitionalScanHelper \u003d new TransitionalScanHelper(this, this::isTestModeEnabled);\n        }\n    }\n```\n\nand then you can keep this in the start if you don\u0027t want to change too much (yet)\n```\n        if (!Flags.scanManagerRefactor()) {\n            HandlerThread thread \u003d new HandlerThread(\"BluetoothScanManager\");\n            thread.start();\n            mTransitionalScanHelper.start(thread.getLooper());\n        }\n```",
